# Voice of Resurgence dying on Bot2's own turn: Bot2's Lightning Bolt is cast during Bot2's turn, not Bot1's, so only the death
# trigger makes a token (one, not two). The token counts only Bot1's creatures, itself: 1/1, though Bot2 controls an Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Voice of Resurgence
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

